  L3  THE UNIFIED OBSTRUCTION THEOREM -- why all three routes had to fail
==========================================================================================================
  Z_framework / sqrt(pi) = 4*sqrt(6)/3   -> rational: False
  Z_framework^2 / pi     = 32/3   -> rational: True
  [OK] L3a CORRECTED from my first draft, which asserted Z/sqrt(pi) is RATIONAL. It is not: Z_framework/sqrt(pi) = 4*sqrt(6)/3, an algebraic IRRATIONAL. The true statement is the other half: Z_framework^2/pi = 32/3 IS rational, so Z^2 is in the class rational x pi^1 while Z itself carries pi^(1/2) times an algebraic irrational
  [OK] L3b and for every integer k in [-2, -1, 0, 1, 2], Z_framework/pi^k is NOT rational (5/5) -- because it always retains pi^(1/2 - k) and pi is transcendental. *** THEREFORE: any construction whose ingredients are rational multiples of INTEGER powers of pi can force Z^2 but can NEVER force Z. ***

  THAT IS THE UNIFIED REASON ALL 12 ATTEMPTS FAILED, and it is not bad luck:
    * the spectral axis fixes W_n = 1/(n pi Z^n) -- linear in 1/Z^n for the chosen n, and every candidate
      constant offered was rational x pi^k;
    * the horizon-entropy route supplies 4pi (area), 4 (Bekenstein-Hawking), 4pi/3 (volume), 2pi (Unruh,
      Gibbons-Hawking), 8pi (Einstein), 3 (Friedmann) -- all rational x pi^(integer);
    * de Sitter thermality supplies exactly one number, 2pi (L1a).
